{
  "lessonId": "L1M1L3",
  "title": "義大利地理與氣候",
  "content": "<div class='slides'><section class='slide-cover'><h1>🗺️ 義大利地理與氣候</h1><p class='subtitle'>從阿爾卑斯山到西西里島的風土之旅</p></section><section class='slide'><h2>🌍 義大利的地理優勢</h2><div class='stats-grid'><div class='stat-card'><div class='stat-icon'>📏</div><div class='stat-number'>1,200</div><div class='stat-label'>公里南北長度</div></div><div class='stat-card'><div class='stat-icon'>🏔️</div><div class='stat-number'>35%</div><div class='stat-label'>山地</div></div><div class='stat-card'><div class='stat-icon'>🌄</div><div class='stat-number'>42%</div><div class='stat-label'>丘陵</div></div><div class='stat-card'><div class='stat-icon'>🌾</div><div class='stat-number'>23%</div><div class='stat-label'>平原</div></div></div><div class='highlight-box'><p><strong>地中海中心的葡萄酒王國</strong></p><p>狹長的半島地形，三面環海，造就了極其多樣化的風土條件</p></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🌡️ 三大氣候帶</h2><div class='climate-zones'><div class='zone-card'><div class='zone-header north'>🏔️ 北部 - 大陸性氣候</div><div class='zone-body'><p><strong>產區：</strong>Piemonte, Lombardy, Veneto</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>冬冷夏熱，晝夜溫差大</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>高酸度、優雅、陳年潛力強</p><p><strong>代表酒款：</strong>Barolo, Amarone</p></div></div><div class='zone-card'><div class='zone-header central'>🌿 中部 - 地中海氣候</div><div class='zone-body'><p><strong>產區：</strong>Toscana, Umbria, Marche</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>溫暖乾燥夏季，溫和冬季</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>結構平衡、風味複雜</p><p><strong>代表酒款：</strong>Chianti, Brunello</p></div></div><div class='zone-card'><div class='zone-header south'>☀️ 南部 - 炎熱氣候</div><div class='zone-body'><p><strong>產區：</strong>Puglia, Sicily, Calabria</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>炎熱乾燥，日照充足</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>濃郁、酒精度高、果味豐富</p><p><strong>代表酒款：</strong>Primitivo, Nero d'Avola</p></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>⛰️ 地形的影響</h2><div class='terrain-grid'><div class='terrain-item'><div class='terrain-icon'>🏔️</div><h3>阿爾卑斯山區</h3><p>海拔 200-500m 的山坡葡萄園</p><p>涼爽氣候 → 高酸度、優雅風格</p><p><strong>代表：</strong>Nebbiolo, Pinot Noir</p></div><div class='terrain-item'><div class='terrain-icon'>🌄</div><h3>亞平寧丘陵</h3><p>托斯卡納經典產區</p><p>排水良好 → 濃縮風味</p><p><strong>代表：</strong>Sangiovese, Trebbiano</p></div><div class='terrain-item'><div class='terrain-icon'>🏝️</div><h3>火山土壤</h3><p>Sicily Etna, Campania Vesuvius</p><p>礦物質豐富 → 獨特風味</p><p><strong>代表：</strong>Nerello, Aglianico</p></div><div class='terrain-item'><div class='terrain-icon'>🌊</div><h3>海洋影響</div><p>Liguria, Sardegna 沿海產區</p><p>海風調節 → 清爽風格</p><p><strong>代表：</strong>Vermentino, Pigato</p></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍇 土壤類型多樣性</h2><div class='soil-types'><div class='soil-card'><div class='soil-name'>🪨 石灰岩 (Calcareous)</div><div class='soil-regions'>Piemonte (Barolo), Toscana</div><div class='soil-effect'>排水佳，賦予優雅與礦物感</div></div><div class='soil-card'><div class='soil-name'>🧱 黏土 (Clay)</div><div class='soil-regions'>Toscana (Chianti), Umbria</div><div class='soil-effect'>保水性好，葡萄飽滿有力</div></div><div class='soil-card'><div class='soil-name'>🌋 火山土 (Volcanic)</div><div class='soil-regions'>Sicily (Etna), Campania</div><div class='soil-effect'>礦物質豐富，風味獨特</div></div><div class='soil-card'><div class='soil-name'>⛰️ 砂岩 (Sandstone)</div><div class='soil-regions'>Veneto, Friuli</div><div class='soil-effect'>早熟，果香明顯</div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🎓 重點總結</h2><div class='key-takeaways'><div class='takeaway-item'>✓ 南北跨越 10 個緯度，氣候差異巨大</div><div class='takeaway-item'>✓ 丘陵地形最適合釀酒葡萄種植</div><div class='takeaway-item'>✓ 海拔、朝向、土壤共同決定風土</div><div class='takeaway-item'>✓ 北部優雅、中部平衡、南部濃郁</div></div><div class='map-prompt'><p>💡 <strong>建議：</strong>點擊「互動地圖」按鈕，探索義大利 20 個產區的地理分布！</p></div></section></div><style>.climate-zones{display:grid;gap:20px;margin:20px 0}.zone-card{border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.zone-header{padding:15px;color:#fff;font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:700;text-align:center}.zone-header.north{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3498db,#2980b9)}.zone-header.central{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#27ae60,#229954)}.zone-header.south{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e74c3c,#c0392b)}.zone-body{background:#fff;padding:20px}.zone-body p{margin:10px 0;line-height:1.6}.zone-body strong{color:#2c3e50}.terrain-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:20px;margin:20px 0}.terrain-item{background:#f8f9fa;padding:25px;border-radius:12px;border-top:4px solid #667eea;text-align:center}.terrain-icon{font-size:3rem;margin-bottom:10px}.terrain-item h3{font-size:1.2rem;color:#2c3e50;margin:10px 0}.terrain-item p{margin:8px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#555}.terrain-item strong{color:#667eea}.soil-types{display:grid;gap:15px;margin:20px 0}.soil-card{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#f8f9fa,#fff);padding:20px;border-radius:10px;border-left:5px solid #667eea;transition:all .3s}.soil-card:hover{transform:translateX(5px);box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.soil-name{font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:700;color:#2c3e50;margin-bottom:8px}.soil-regions{color:#667eea;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:5px}.soil-effect{color:#555;font-style:italic}.key-takeaways{display:grid;gap:12px;margin:20px 0}.takeaway-item{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#e8f5e9,transparent);padding:18px 25px;border-left:4px solid #4caf50;font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:600;color:#2c3e50}.map-prompt{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff3e0,#ffe0b2);padding:20px;border-radius:12px;text-align:center;margin-top:20px;border:2px dashed #ff9800}.map-prompt p{margin:0;font-size:1.1rem}</style>",
